></p>\n\t<p>It’s notable (*cough*) that some of the banknotes are designed vertically vs horizontally. The influence of portrait mode on smartphones?\n</p>\n \n\n        \n         <p><strong>Tags:</strong> <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/currency\">currency</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/design\">design</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/European%20Union\">European Union</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/money\">money</a></p>\n        \n    ","author":"Jason Kottke","siteTitle":"Kottke","siteHash":"89a883271b4598f9b33ebe87be70d38557bcd266e68aee521a8f93622e0ab723","entryHash":"161b2c87a84811b4d9237b5dcfd9f2275f2f177c3d1c67d0b6274d634c7f2b21","category":"Sites"}